sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, and defect pair annihilation — MorphoEval overall 48.9/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2007-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces.py` (consensus score 52.8/100). The v1 script evaluates an analytical Cabrera-Levine phase field for a single isolated screw dislocation (r_c=0.42 um, lambda_0=7.97 um), but omits opposite-chirality (+b, -b) Frank-Read target-ring generation for d > 2*r_c, subcritical dipole annihilation for d <= 2*r_c (negative control), same-chirality (+b, +b) double spirals, 3D bivalve sheet vs gastropod tower nacre architectures, 12-species cross-taxa BCF pitch scaling, and computer-vision segmentation of the vendored SEM nacre aragonite tablet specimen. Overall 48.9/100 (faithfulness 41.6, reproducibility 65.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 56, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 70. Output judged: docs/media/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces_comparison.png: rendered output of 2007-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces.py at HEAD, image/png, 63778 B, 1218×587 px, artifact_sha256 0169fac579d7769b451d157d047d49d951ee1b5f28d07bcb4b56f21d71662844 (sha256 0169fac579d7769b451d157d047d49d951ee1b5f28d07bcb4b56f21d71662844), spec_fingerprint 4c231c8398be9a26483bc4175fe15077a90c9e9b18a12deaf2c2e4265b43d447. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4c231c8398be9a26483bc4175fe15077a90c9e9b18a12deaf2c2e4265b43d447; artifact_sha256: 0169fac579d7769b451d157d047d49d951ee1b5f28d07bcb4b56f21d71662844; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/nacre_aragonite_tablets_specimen.jpg=e4c6590464523f21..., datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces_reference.json=580b05d6121d9596..., datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/scout_manifest.json=6084a2ce133990fc...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--v-inf`, `--r-c`, `--h-0`, `--dipole-d`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 2-panel growth GIF.",
            "remediation needed: Implement a 2D multi-dislocation eikonal / excitable step-flow & 3D terrace solver covering all 4 Cartwright-Checa chiral dislocation morphospace regimes: (1) subcritical Frank-Read dipole (d = 0.60 um < 2*r_c = 0.84 um -> pinch-off annihilation negative control, 0 active terraces), (2) single screw dislocation (+b = +1 -> Archimedean spiral in bivalve sheet nacre *Pteria*), (3) supercritical opposite-chirality Frank-Read pair (+b, -b, d = 2.40 um > 2*r_c, b_net = 0 -> closed concentric target terraces), and (4) same-chirality pair (+b, +b, b_net = +2 -> interlocked double-spiral & gastropod columnar tower nacre *Haliotis*).",
            "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/` at runtime, validate the universal BCF terrace pitch law lambda_0 = (2*pi/omega_0)*r_c ≈ 18.9848*r_c and angular velocity law omega = omega_0*v_inf/r_c across 12 empirical bivalve sheet-nacre and gastropod/cephalopod tower-nacre species, and verify discrete contour winding numbers around single, target, and double-spiral cores.",
            "remediation needed: Perform computer-vision lamellar seam segmentation (`segment_nacre_sem_specimen`) on the vendored SEM fractured mother-of-pearl specimen (`nacre_aragonite_tablets_specimen.jpg`), measuring inter-lamellar chitin-protein mortar spacing h_0 (25.17 px = 0.5000 um, CV = 0.2933), aragonite tablet aspect ratio (3.2436), and vertical column layer count (14.12 layers)." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.489"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Pass 1 baseline assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

